msgstr "Select which courses to upgrade from a previous version of WeBWorK.  The upgrade process can add missing database columns, delete unused database columns, and check the course file structure.  Be sure to read over the changes before confirming the upgrade.  You may want to create an archive of the course before upgrading.  Only courses that need upgraded will be selectable."

