"represent a difficult problem.  Note that problems with multiple parts may "
"have higher average attempts since many students  will submit an answer to "
"each part before continuing and each such  submittal counts as an attempt."
msgstr "The Attempts figure is the global average of the number of attempts (both correct and incorrect) individuals take on this problem.  A high figure may represent a difficult problem.  Note that problems with multiple parts may have higher average attempts since many students  will submit an answer to each part before continuing and each such  submittal counts as an attempt."

