msgstr "This specifies the rerandomisation period: the number of attempts before a new version of the problem is generated by changing the Seed value. Randomisation is disabled if \"Never\" is selected."

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorPGProblemEditor.html.ep:256
