"This tab is only available for problem files, set header files, and hardcopy "
"header files, but is not active for a new problem template or a sample "
"problem. To append a new problem template or sample problem to a set, first "
"use \"Save As\" to save the file to the course templates directory."
msgstr "This tab is only available for problem files, set header files, and hardcopy header files, but is not active for a new problem template or a sample problem. To append a new problem template or sample problem to a set, first use \"Save As\" to save the file to the course templates directory."

